  "title": "Apricot Jam",
  "description": "Homemade apricot jam with just 3 easy ingredients: fresh apricots, lemon juice, and sugar. Spread on toasted bread for a delicious fruity treat!",
  "authors": [
    "Megan"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:49:59-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2025-10-28T12:19:02-04:00",
  "prep_time": "PT20M",
  "cook_time": "PT40M",
  "total_time": "PT120M",
  "yield": [
    "50",
    "5 (1-pint) jars"
  ],
  "categories": [
    "Jam / Jelly"
  ],
  "cuisines": [
    "American"
  ],
  "regions": [
    "American"
  ],
  "breadcrumbs": [],
  "keywords": [],
  "ingredients": [
    "8 cups fresh apricots - peeled, pitted, and crushed",
    "0.25 cup lemon juice",
    "6 cups white sugar"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cqZKbxzyBHZeWRV2uon1QtXBwU4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222949-apricot-jam-VAT-step-01-b62fd8ec1c7c4d229940f31d0f3e6a38.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222949/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix apricots and lemon juice in a large pot over medium heat; add sugar and slowly bring to a boil, stirring until sugar dissolves.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JEymXIsYPj-9y7Pzw3GtpgBHm7s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222949-apricot-jam-VAT-step-02-5986c3bd299f428b99bb52ff2851d95a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222949/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Continue to cook and stir until apricot mixture thickens, about 25 minutes. Remove from heat and skim foam off the top if necessary.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9N7eSMmYXsb7F_J_gbHy1FgRtkM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222949-apricot-jam-VAT-step-03-1db42d49df1846ab919f357466bf1bda.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222949/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, prepare five 1-pint jars with lids and rings by cleaning and sterilizing them in the dishwasher or a boiling water bath. Leave lids in simmering water until ready to seal jars.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/z5pNwSEG2Hmfz0k78oW5i0je2YY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222949-apricot-jam-VAT-step-04-9ef068baac4d428888e57db497e1d821.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222949/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ladle hot jam into hot sterilized jars, leaving about 1/4 inch of space on top. Run a knife or a thin spatula around the insides of the jars after they have been filled to remove any air bubbles.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/eNZn4Bz-HF1oe5hl2gGh_K8c2KE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222949-apricot-jam-VAT-step-05-e3afffad67c84bc39ecefceabd750a5e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222949/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wipe the rims of the jars with a moist paper towel to remove any food residue. Top with lids, and screw on rings.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XgYO12P1nga6jVh8I5btrroHb00=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222949-apricot-jam-VAT-step-06-8713c49532f544229e405c1303a1ee73.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222949/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place a rack in the bottom of a large stockpot and fill halfway with water. Bring to a boil, then carefully lower the jars into the pot using a holder, leaving a 2-inch space between the jars. Pour in more boiling water if necessary until the water level is at least 1 inch above the tops of the jars. Bring the water to a full boil, cover the pot, and process for 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cQg4rq44wGfzzu39tWXFVPXATJg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222949-apricot-jam-VAT-step-07-e0b6e48423e542f99b353fefd5744d3d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222949/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove the jars from the stockpot and place them onto a cloth-covered or wood surface, several inches apart, until cool. Once cool, press the top of each lid with a finger, ensuring that the seal is tight and the lid does not move up or down at all. Store in a cool, dark area.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VObSf3LEqxlqA0vcAKlgSikSrTg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222949-apricot-jam-VAT-step-08-6345a73e9fe64aeeac550fd2bdbd5048.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222949/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
